{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_title", "source_sha256": "9e8d0cc29842582f75db820442c61fc5dedb3ff82d5992cb10c1d054e5157149", "ja": "14thLIVE 織々の花だより 留守電", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "42d8fa6cb1a571badc07e440da7adc2e1c21f80a1279fffaa152fb756be69d25", "ja": "14thLIVE DAY1『夢咲くワンダーミラ\nージュ 織々の花だより』を無事に終えた\nエミリーからの留守番電話です。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1000_032emi", "source_sha256": "4247017c17aaa406e65b794cb00f961a8fb4a983d917f4af3a6d62228ec9d1a6", "ja": "あの……仕掛け人さま？\n夜分に恐れ入ります。エミリーです。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "00560be596436bd9f6c6a197dff7386ca04967676cd257c9f61487a6e4be513a", "ja": "こんな時間にお電話を差し上げるのは、はしたないとも\n思ったのですが……どうしても、我慢できなくて……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "d8de449e8fbb3e88d92eb022a33177895ca36e69c944cbb1e29d6ed99523698f", "ja": "このまま少しだけ、お話しさせてください。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "482838c1673f630d0367a6a0292cb8d35436a71d97cb553b87a9c9db2f6b6e55", "ja": "本日の主演公演、『織々の花だより』……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "6bdc853fc912c2b1e8ddd82f99b4711db52f729758f23726b8c6f537459ef2f7", "ja": "このような晴れの舞台に私を立たせてくださって、\n本当にありがとうございました。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "a587ce5508267b818dcc490c202982af4bd26b46b1c7e0803212dc1ed8e96236", "ja": "立派な大和撫子を目指して、精進を積み重ねて……。\nもちろん、まだまだ未熟なのですが……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "5897a61bf9349a77f32cf4e68ad1a9238be12f183050115d42029388d944ba9c", "ja": "それでも今日の舞台では……\n私が今までめぐり逢い、出逢ってきた憧れを……", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "8984a3089c49f8c04727286792e840bd0eeca927014d2d3ca75fab7672e96c0e", "ja": "そして、みなさまと一緒に過ごしてきた日々を、\n糸のように紡いで、織りあげて……", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "b72ccd6a834153378ee1881aeec69c44327af09e3ba36907e1ba5dfe3e00fc7c", "ja": "今の私にできる精一杯を、\nお届けすることができました。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "f7ec7ac3f5ca76e66afe758b7e2b118a2a93a3a9f93d6ba4fc24a5284d76a190", "ja": "あの……仕掛け人さま。\n仕掛け人さまにとって、今日の私は……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "4cfa97b203b31c07a3f0e50d8ab10d5e0c33c03fa5d0c7255a1f38dd33a01643", "ja": "エミリーは、\n大和撫子でしたか……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "3a756367f26482981a62c0505f1057d00651ee90e47c024677c48890c93be291", "ja": "もし……少しでもそう思っていただけていたら、\nとても……とても、うれしいです……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "6b479832725727b26c00892567961a41789e5d9e5b4551073eff3251e332befe", "ja": "終演の瞬間まで、全部の時間が大切で、愛しくて、\nかけがえのない……そんな公演でした。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "aba32c50ba7b38944002a5e2272122497ad24e52794ce75c3218f40353822ce0", "ja": "あっ、ごめんなさい。あの、ですから……えっと、\nそんな公演を、まつりさんに見てもらえたことも……", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "2563866a032737423606415a7d7818bdf9ac17aca6b35910926ed2b801d77d51", "ja": "またお隣に立てたことも、とてもうれしかったです…！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "c0a669e99fece3cfbb9efa4f52ac423b3329fb3af72741f5d22e513327de6d23", "ja": "長々と話しこんでしまってごめんなさい！\n……夜もすっかり更けてきましたね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "2ce2d1ba7d055c21d79498bcc0fb753d3ebd839eb73010ee7a8824cca8bd2645", "ja": "まだお仕事でお忙しいのでしょうか……。\nあまり無理をなさらず、ご自愛くださいね？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_02_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "32986bbb2a9e39cd545ee3d688e9f1788dc8fbc5afcb0f6ac924b737917a188c", "ja": "それでは、失礼いたします。\n……仕掛け人さま。……おやすみなさい。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
